            <ArticleTitle>[Back pain in pregnant women].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>231-6</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>In the paper a problem of spinal ailments in women in the third trimester of pregnancy is presented. The study concerns the changes of both body posture and pulvis position. Some disadvantageous situations pregnant women meet with, which cause feeling of pain in spine are analyzed. The alarming lack of proper knowledge about phenomenon of spinal pain in pregnant women is also pointed out.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
